    885  f0fe							; = 11+3 = 76, zero margin — the `beq` target is 9 bytes ahead, same
    886  f0fe							; page, T=3c; do not let this block grow toward a page edge).
    887  f0fe							; A1 gap fix (2026-10-05): `sta Temp` (+3c in .Row) pushed gaps to
    888  f0fe							; 77/79 = stall EVERY frame (265-line frames). `sta LineCount` moved
