    890  f0fe							; first body line (66max+3LC[+3jmp]+3WSYNC = 75 rows0/1, 72 row2).
    891  f0fe							; LineCount is not read until the line's `dec` tail — the early store
    892  f0fe							; was never required; keep the store strictly between WSYNC and .Line.
