   1212  f202							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1213  f202							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1214  f202							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1215  f202							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1216  f202							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1217  f202							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1218  f202				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1219  f202							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
