   2387  f752							; frame in any room that also had another object. The miner's mirror is
   2388  f752							; gone (a design-based mirror like the LAMP's type 13 needs 32 more art
   2389  f752							; bytes and the table ends 6 B below the $F8C0 pin), so every GRP1 object
