   3482  fc8d							; LoseLife — the single life-loss path (enemy hit, timer expiry, bomb blast,
   3483  fc8d							; hot rock, band). Returns C=1: lives exhausted, ReloadLevel already done
   3484  fc8d							; (LoadLevel re-places the player — callers skip their stay action).
   3485  fc8d							; C=0: still alive — physics zeroed here; caller does its per-site stay
   3486  fc8d							; action (bar reload, RoomY shift). Tail-callable (`jmp LoseLife`).
   3487  fc8d							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
