   3508  fca5							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3509  fca5							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   3510  fca5							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   3511  fca5							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit). Post-pad leaf (bank0 pre-pad
   3512  fca5							; is at its 1B limit); reached from CheckEnemyHit's type-6 dispatch by jmp
   3513  fca5							; (out of `beq` range). KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit.
   3514  fca5							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   3515  fca5							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   3516  fca5							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   3517  fca5							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3518  fca5							; IsRoomDark / SetRoomDark + BitMaskTable moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan B).
   3519  fca5
   3520  fca5							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3521  fca5							; CheckBandTouch — overscan: if band on and sprite touches the water strip →
   3522  fca5							; life. Strip = bottom ~12 lines of the cave (bottom_band_plan rule 2);
   3523  fca5							; sprite origin RoomY >= 115 enters it (115 + 21 = 136 = the same feet
   3524  fca5							; depth the 12-row sprite had at 125).
   3525  fca5							; Same path as hot/enemy: lose life, then respawn 12 scanlines up (min 0).
   3526  fca5							; Band color = VBLANK-staged RoomBandColor ($D2, PF1Buf[3] dead-row alias;
   3527  fca5							; staged by the VBLANK fold from LevelEnemy+RoomNo*4+3 — a kernel-time fold
   3528  fca5							; overruns the .WaterRow line). Read inlined here and in .WaterRow (0 = off).
   3529  fca5							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3530  fca5				   CheckBandTouch
   3531  fca5		       a5 bc		      lda	RoomBandColor
