   3540  fcb3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3541  fcb3							; LoseLifeBand — life path + respawn just above the water strip.
   3542  fcb3							; The shift MUST happen BEFORE LoseLife: its stay path tail-jumps DropArm,
   3543  fcb3							; which freezes RoomY as the drop destiny. Shifting after the call was dead
   3544  fcb3							; code — a water death respawned at the death Y (inside the strip, >= 125) and
   3545  fcb3							; the player died again on landing, unable to fly out (user report 2026-10-21).
   3546  fcb3							; The shift is one tile (spec: -= 12, not the whole band): the band check
   3547  fcb3							; tests the sprite ORIGIN (RoomY >= 115), so 115 -> 103 clears the strip.
   3548  fcb3							; Tail-jmps LoseLife (never returns here): its exhausted path rts straight to
   3549  fcb3							; CheckBandTouch.
   3550  fcb3							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3551  fcb3				   LoseLifeBand
   3552  fcb3		       a5 81		      lda	RoomY
   3553  fcb5		       38		      sec
   3554  fcb6		       e9 0c		      sbc	#12	; one tile up
   3555  fcb8		       b0 02		      bcs	.LLBstore
   3556  fcba		       a9 00		      lda	#0	; near the top: clamp at 0
   3557  fcbc				   .LLBstore
   3558  fcbc		       85 81		      sta	RoomY
   3559  fcbe		       4c 8d fc 	      jmp	LoseLife	; freezes this Y as DropTarget and drops in
