   3782  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3783  fda9							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3784  fda9							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3785  fda9							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3786  fda9							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3787  fda9							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3788  fda9							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3789  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3790  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3791  fda9							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3792  fda9							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3793  fda9							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF4 always
   3794  fda9							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3795  fda9							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3796  fda9							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3797  fda9							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3798  fda9							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3799  fda9							;   in S3.0b.
   3800  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3801  fda9
   3802  fda9							; UpdateBombSound moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan batch A) — CallPad_UpdateBombSound.
   3803  fda9
   3804  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3805  fda9							; ColOff/ColMask — cell-walk lookup tables (cell_collision_plan).
   3806  fda9							;   Indexed by LEFT-HALF source col 0-19 (PHM prologue mirrors right-half
   3807  fda9							;   ranges before the walk; bank2 display-space walkers mirror first too).
   3808  fda9							;   ColOff: byte offset from PF0Buf+row ($C3+row) to the register holding
   3809  fda9							;   that col (0/3/6 = PF0/PF1/PF2 row byte). ColMask: the col's bit in that
   3810  fda9							;   byte — PF0 bit4+col (cols 0-3), PF1 MSB-first (4-11), PF2 LSB-first
   3811  fda9							;   (12-19); matches convert_room.pf_values (plan 0.2 spec, proven by
   3812  fda9							;   tools/test_cell_map.py).
   3813  fda9							;   (The standalone CellSolid leaf that lived here moved INTO
   3814  fda9							;   PlayerHitsMap's walk as inline code — a jsr in the walk cost 2B of
   3815  fda9							;   stack depth and would break sim_bomb_fuse's gameplay min-SP >= $F8
   3816  fda9							;   guard; the post-pad slot keeps these tables abs,X-reachable.)
   3817  fda9							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
